    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Gallery</i>, a mysterious first-person puzzle adventure where every painting hides a secret. Navigate two eerie galleries, each containing eight rooms filled with mind-bending puzzles, cryptic clues, and interactive artwork. To progress, you must decipher riddles, manipulate paintings, and uncover hidden patterns to unlock the next door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no time limits, an immersive ambient soundtrack, and a unique collectible system, <i>The Gallery </i>offers a relaxed yet thought-provoking experience. Observe, experiment, and solve\u2014can you uncover the gallery\u2019s ultimate mystery?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f <strong>Painting-Based Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Change, rearrange, and decode artwork to solve intricate riddles.<br>\ud83d\udd0e <strong>Interactive Environment</strong> \u2013 Pull levers, rotate paintings, and manipulate objects to unlock secrets.<br>\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Atmospheric Soundtrack</strong> \u2013 A haunting yet relaxing ambiance enhances the experience.<br>\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Collectibles &amp; Hidden Clues</strong> \u2013 Find and display artifacts that reveal more about the gallery.<br>\ud83d\udeb6 <strong>Explore at Your Own Pace</strong> \u2013 No timers, just a deep dive into the world of art and mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now and prepare to unlock the secrets of <i>The Gallery</i>!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Gallery</i>, a mysterious first-person puzzle adventure where every painting hides a secret. Navigate two eerie galleries, each containing eight rooms filled with mind-bending puzzles, cryptic clues, and interactive artwork. To progress, you must decipher riddles, manipulate paintings, and uncover hidden patterns to unlock the next door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With no time limits, an immersive ambient soundtrack, and a unique collectible system, <i>The Gallery </i>offers a relaxed yet thought-provoking experience. Observe, experiment, and solve\u2014can you uncover the gallery\u2019s ultimate mystery?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f <strong>Painting-Based Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Change, rearrange, and decode artwork to solve intricate riddles.<br>\ud83d\udd0e <strong>Interactive Environment</strong> \u2013 Pull levers, rotate paintings, and manipulate objects to unlock secrets.<br>\ud83c\udfb5 <strong>Atmospheric Soundtrack</strong> \u2013 A haunting yet relaxing ambiance enhances the experience.<br>\ud83d\udcdc <strong>Collectibles &amp; Hidden Clues</strong> \u2013 Find and display artifacts that reveal more about the gallery.<br>\ud83d\udeb6 <strong>Explore at Your Own Pace</strong> \u2013 No timers, just a deep dive into the world of art and mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now and prepare to unlock the secrets of <i>The Gallery</i>!</strong></p>",
